{"seq":8,"slug":"learning-behavioral-psychology","title":"学习与行为心理学","stage":"DONE","category":"psychology","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/h/psychology/learning-behavioral-psychology","rating":{"composite":3.42,"verdict":"watch","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.31,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 学习与行为心理学 简介\n\n学习与行为心理学是研究有机体如何通过经验获得新行为、修正旧行为的核心心理学分支。从巴甫洛夫的唾液分泌实验到斯金纳的操作箱，从班杜拉的社会学习理论到卡尼曼的前景理论，学习心理学的发展历程本身就是一部人类理解自身行为机制的探索史。本知识库面向具有理性思维能力的技术从业者和终身学习者，帮助读者从行为科学的视角重新审视日常工作与生活中的习惯养成、技能习得、决策偏差和行为设计。\n\n全书共分四个章节，从经典实验到现代应用，系统呈现学习与行为心理学的完整知识图谱：\n\n第1章**经典条件反射**从巴甫洛夫的开创性实验出发，详细讲解条件反射的建立机制、习得与消退的动态过程、刺激泛化与分化的原理，以及经典条件反射在广告营销、恐惧治疗和日常习惯中的广泛应用。这一章奠定了理解一切学习现象的基石。\n\n第2章**操作条件反射**以斯金纳的行为主义理论为核心，深入分析正强化与负强化的作用机制、惩罚的多面效应与局限、不同强化程序表对行为稳定性的影响，以及塑造与链锁技术在复杂行为训练中的运用。理解操作条件反射对于产品设计中的激励机制和个人习惯养成都具有直接的指导价值。\n\n第3章**认知社会学习**超越传统行为主义的刺激-反应框架，探讨班杜拉的观察学习理论、自我效能感的形成与影响、习得性无助的心理机制，以及托尔曼的认知地图概念如何揭示学习过程中的内在认知表征。这一章展现了学习心理学从纯行为主义向认知整合方向的重要转变。\n\n第4章**行为经济学与心理学**将学习与行为理论延伸至决策领域，涵盖前景理论对理性人假设的颠覆、助推理论在公共政策中的巧妙应用、损失厌恶对日常决策的深刻影响，以及行为设计在产品开发和组织管理中的系统化实践。这一章将行为科学的洞见转化为可操作的设计原则。\n\n推荐学习路径为：先从第1章经典条件反射入手，掌握最基础的联结学习机制；再进入第2章操作条件反射，理解行为后果如何塑造未来行为；然后学习第3章认知社会学习，认识到学习不仅仅是简单的刺激-反应联结；最后在第4章行为经济学中，将行为科学的理论知识应用于真实世界的决策与设计。四章内容层层递进，从基础联结到认知整合再到实际应用，构成一幅完整的学习与行为心理学知识图谱。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"classical-conditioning","title":"经典条件反射","docCount":4,"url":"/h/psychology/learning-behavioral-psychology/classical-conditioning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pavlov-conditioning","title":"巴甫洛夫条件反射","url":"/h/psychology/learning-behavioral-psychology/classical-conditioning/pavlov-conditioning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"acquisition-extinction","title":"习得与消退","url":"/h/psychology/learning-behavioral-psychology/classical-conditioning/acquisition-extinction"},{"seq":3,"slug":"stimulus-generalization","title":"刺激泛化与分化","url":"/h/psychology/learning-behavioral-psychology/classical-conditioning/stimulus-generalization"},{"seq":4,"slug":"classical-applications","title":"经典条件反射的应用","url":"/h/psychology/learning-behavioral-psychology/classical-conditioning/classical-applications"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"operant-conditioning","title":"操作条件反射","docCount":4,"url":"/h/psychology/learning-behavioral-psychology/operant-conditioning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"skinner-reinforcement","title":"斯金纳强化理论","url":"/h/psychology/learning-behavioral-psychology/operant-conditioning/skinner-reinforcement"},{"seq":2,"slug":"punishment-effects","title":"惩罚的效应与局限","url":"/h/psychology/learning-behavioral-psychology/operant-conditioning/punishment-effects"},{"seq":3,"slug":"schedules-reinforcement","title":"强化程序表","url":"/h/psychology/learning-behavioral-psychology/operant-conditioning/schedules-reinforcement"},{"seq":4,"slug":"shaping-chaining","title":"塑造与链锁","url":"/h/psychology/learning-behavioral-psychology/operant-conditioning/shaping-chaining"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"cognitive-social-learning","title":"认知社会学习","docCount":4,"url":"/h/psychology/learning-behavioral-psychology/cognitive-social-learning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"observational-learning","title":"观察学习","url":"/h/psychology/learning-behavioral-psychology/cognitive-social-learning/observational-learning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"self-efficacy","title":"自我效能感","url":"/h/psychology/learning-behavioral-psychology/cognitive-social-learning/self-efficacy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"learned-helplessness","title":"习得性无助","url":"/h/psychology/learning-behavioral-psychology/cognitive-social-learning/learned-helplessness"},{"seq":4,"slug":"cognitive-maps","title":"认知地图","url":"/h/psychology/learning-behavioral-psychology/cognitive-social-learning/cognitive-maps"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"behavioral-economics","title":"行为经济学与心理学","docCount":4,"url":"/h/psychology/learning-behavioral-psychology/behavioral-economics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prospect-theory","title":"前景理论","url":"/h/psychology/learning-behavioral-psychology/behavioral-economics/prospect-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"nudge-theory","title":"助推理论","url":"/h/psychology/learning-behavioral-psychology/behavioral-economics/nudge-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"loss-aversion","title":"损失厌恶","url":"/h/psychology/learning-behavioral-psychology/behavioral-economics/loss-aversion"},{"seq":4,"slug":"behavioral-design","title":"行为设计","url":"/h/psychology/learning-behavioral-psychology/behavioral-economics/behavioral-design"}]}]}